          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>In <strong>2024</strong>, against the vibrant backdrop of Bharat’s evolving creative landscape, <strong>ONREPEAT</strong> was born — a fashion and lifestyle brand rooted in purpose, expression, and culture.</p><p> Founded by <strong>Paras Soni</strong>, ONREPEAT emerged from a vision to redefine contemporary apparel and lifestyle in India through thoughtful design and artistic identity.</p><p>Spotting a space where authentic self-expression and elevated design could coexist, Paras set out to create more than just a clothing label. </p><p>He envisioned a platform where every silhouette, texture, and graphic tells a story — grounded in nature, emotion, rebellion, and everyday rhythm.</p><p></p>",
